Trolls is a family, animation, fantasy film directed by Mike Mitchell.

3
00:13:08,571 --> 00:13:14,571
After the monstrous Bergens invade Troll Village, Princess Poppy, the happiest Troll ever born, and
overly-cautious, curmudgeonly outcast Branch set off on a journey to rescue her friends.

4
00:17:31,428 --> 00:17:37,428
Their mission is full of adventure and mishaps, as this mismatched duo try
to tolerate each other long enough to get the job done.

